      "raw_text": "Final data from the randomized, blinded, placebo-controlled Phase 1 trial evaluating soquelitinib in patients with moderate-to-severe atopic dermatitis will be presented in two oral sessions at the Society for Investigative Dermatology (SID) Annual Meeting, which is taking place May 13-16, 2026 in Chicago. The Company will host an in-person and virtual investor and analyst meeting on May 14, 2026 to review soquelitinib data being presented at SID."
